ja:
二つの簡単な接近法を比較する。$x$方向に沿っては$dy=0$なので、 $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_x
  =\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  +i\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}.$ である。$y$方向に沿っては$dx=0$であり、 $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_y
  =\frac{1}{i}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  +\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  -i\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}.$ である。実部と虚部の等置から $\boxed{
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y},
  \qquad
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  =-\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}}$ が得られる。これらがCauchy–Riemann方程式である。通常の微分可能性の仮定の下では、それらは極限 [eq:l08-complex-derivative]が方向に依存しないための十分条件でもある。この性質を持つ関数は、その点で解析的、すなわち正則である。

zh:
比较两种简单的逼近方式。沿$x$方向，$dy=0$，所以 $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_x
  =\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  +i\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}.$ 沿$y$方向，$dx=0$，并且 $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_y
  =\frac{1}{i}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  +\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  -i\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}.$ 实部与虚部分别相等给出 $\boxed{
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y},
  \qquad
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  =-\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}}$ 这就是柯西–黎曼方程。在通常的可微性假设下，它们也足以使极限 [eq:l08-complex-derivative]与方向无关。具有这一性质的函数在该点解析，或称全纯。

fr:
Comparons deux approches simples. Dans la direction $x$, $dy=0$, donc $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_x
  =\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  +i\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}.$ Dans la direction $y$, $dx=0$, et $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_y
  =\frac{1}{i}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  +\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  -i\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}.$ L’égalité des parties réelle et imaginaire donne $\boxed{
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y},
  \qquad
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  =-\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}}$ Ce sont les équations de Cauchy–Riemann. Sous les hypothèses usuelles de différentiabilité, elles suffisent aussi à garantir que la limite [eq:l08-complex-derivative] est indépendante de la direction. Une fonction qui possède cette propriété est dite analytique, ou holomorphe, au point considéré.

es:
Comparemos dos aproximaciones sencillas. En la dirección $x$, $dy=0$, así que $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_x
  =\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  +i\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}.$ En la dirección $y$, $dx=0$, y $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_y
  =\frac{1}{i}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  +\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  -i\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}.$ La igualdad de las partes real e imaginaria da $\boxed{
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y},
  \qquad
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  =-\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}}$ Estas son las ecuaciones de Cauchy–Riemann. Bajo los supuestos habituales de diferenciabilidad, también bastan para que el límite [eq:l08-complex-derivative] sea independiente de la dirección. Una función con esta propiedad es analítica, u holomorfa, en ese punto.

zh-Hant:
比較兩種簡單的趨近方式。沿$x$方向，$dy=0$，因此 $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_x
  =\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  +i\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}.$ 沿$y$方向，$dx=0$，且 $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_y
  =\frac{1}{i}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  +\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  -i\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}.$ 分別比較實部與虛部，得到 $\boxed{
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y},
  \qquad
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  =-\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}}$ 這就是柯西–黎曼方程。在通常的可微性假設下，這些方程也足以確保極限[eq:l08-complex-derivative]與趨近方向無關。在該點具有此性質的函數稱為解析函數，或全純函數。

ko:
두 가지 간단한 접근 방향을 비교하자. $x$ 방향을 따라서는 $dy=0$이므로 $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_x
  =\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  +i\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}.$ $y$ 방향을 따라서는 $dx=0$이고, $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_y
  =\frac{1}{i}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  +\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  -i\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}.$ 실수부와 허수부를 각각 같게 놓으면 $\boxed{
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y},
  \qquad
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  =-\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}}$ 이것이 코시–리만 방정식이다. 통상적인 미분 가능성 가정 아래에서는 이 방정식이 극한 [eq:l08-complex-derivative]이 접근 방향에 무관해지기 위한 충분조건이기도 하다. 이 성질을 갖는 함수는 해당 점에서 해석적, 또는 정칙이라고 한다.

vi:
Hãy so sánh hai cách tiến tới đơn giản. Dọc theo hướng $x$, $dy=0$, nên $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_x
  =\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  +i\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}.$ Dọc theo hướng $y$, $dx=0$, và $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_y
  =\frac{1}{i}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  +\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  -i\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}.$ Việc đồng nhất phần thực và phần ảo cho $\boxed{
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y},
  \qquad
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  =-\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}}$ Đây là các phương trình Cauchy–Riemann. Dưới những giả thiết khả vi thông thường, chúng cũng đủ để giới hạn [eq:l08-complex-derivative] độc lập với hướng. Một hàm có tính chất này là giải tích, hay chỉnh hình, tại điểm đó.

ru:
Сравним два простых способа подхода. По направлению $x$, $dy=0$, так что $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_x
  =\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  +i\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}.$ По направлению $y$, $dx=0$, и $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_y
  =\frac{1}{i}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  +\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  -i\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}.$ Равенство действительной и мнимой частей даёт $\boxed{
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y},
  \qquad
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  =-\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}}$ Это уравнения Коши–Римана. При обычных предположениях дифференцируемости они также достаточны для того, чтобы предел [eq:l08-complex-derivative] не зависел от направления. Функция с этим свойством аналитична, или голоморфна, в данной точке.

de:
Vergleichen wir zwei einfache Annäherungsrichtungen. Entlang der $x$-Richtung gilt $dy=0$, also $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_x
  =\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  +i\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}.$ Entlang der $y$-Richtung gilt $dx=0$, und $\left.\frac{dw}{dz}\right|_y
  =\frac{1}{i}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  +\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y}
  -i\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}.$ Der Vergleich von Real- und Imaginärteilen ergibt $\boxed{
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
  =\frac{\partial v}{\partial y},
  \qquad
  \frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
  =-\frac{\partial v}{\partial x}}$ Dies sind die Cauchy–Riemann-Gleichungen. Unter den üblichen Differenzierbarkeitsvoraussetzungen sind sie auch hinreichend dafür, dass der Grenzwert [eq:l08-complex-derivative] richtungsunabhängig ist. Eine Funktion mit dieser Eigenschaft heißt an diesem Punkt analytisch oder holomorph.

p.src:
Write two small complex displacements in polar form: $\delta z=\rho e^{i\theta},
  \qquad
  \Delta z=\rho'e^{i\theta'}.$ Their ratio has phase $\theta-\theta'$, exactly the angle between them. Under an analytic map, $\frac{\delta w}{\delta z}
  =\frac{\Delta w}{\Delta z}
  =w'(z),$ because the derivative does not depend on direction. Rearranging gives $\frac{\Delta z}{\delta z}
  =\frac{\Delta w}{\delta w}.$ The two sides have the same phase, so the angle between the original intervals equals the angle between their images.

